    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Monotonic stack</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/largest-rectangle-in-histogram/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 84</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Largest Rectangle in Histogram</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The best rectangle is always as tall as some bar and stretches until the first lower bar on each side. A stack of indices with rising heights finds both walls of every bar in one pass: when a lower bar arrives, it is the right wall of everything it pops, and the bar under each popped one is its left wall. O(n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
  },
